  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="26">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 26</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="26" corresp="#wit-d-incomplete">And sy ælc wuduwe, þe hy silfe mid rihte gehealde, on Godes griðe ⁊ on ðæs cynges.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="26" corresp="#wit-k">⁊ sy ælc wydewe, þe hy sylfe mid rihte gehealde, on Godes griðe ⁊ on þæs cynges.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And all widows who lead a respectable life shall enjoy the special protection of God and of the king.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und jede Wittwe, die sich ehrlich hält, stehe unter Friedensschutz der Kirche und des Königs.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let every widow who conducts herself rightly be under the protection of God and of the king.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
